{"parentUuid":"c94a434c-2982-47a9-b605-982505f3efbf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eea1a00a-fa8d-4ce0-963d-d0f411062aaf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RCSq2r11w8iY7JY3Y7nxQT","type":"tool_result","content":"# Runway Dev Video Models Overview\n\nBased on the documentation, here are the key video generation models:\n\n## Primary Video Models\n\n**Gen-4.5**\n- Model ID: `gen4.5`\n- Inputs: Text or Image\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n- Features: \"true HDR renders — graded into BT.2020 with measured HDR10 metadata\"\n- Output formats: HDR10, HLG, ProRes, PNG sequences, 10-bit SDR\n\n**Seedance 2.5**\n- Model ID: `seedance2_5`\n- Inputs: Text, Image, or Video\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n\n**Aleph 2**\n- Model ID: `aleph2`\n- Inputs: Video + Text/Image\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/video_to_video`\n- Note: Does not deliver native HDR; use SDR to HDR conversion for HDR content\n\n**Gen-4 Turbo**\n- Model ID: `gen4_turbo`\n- Inputs: Image only\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n\n## Additional Options\n\nOther available models include `wan3`, `hailuo3`, `veo3.1`, `h3_max`, and `happyhorse_1_0`. The documentation does not specify duration limits or aspect ratio options for individual models in the provided content."}]},"uuid":"b8d87a63-aae7-4566-82c6-e2e2e4fc1914","timestamp":"2026-09-21T01:18:13.584Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":28705,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Runway Dev Video Models Overview\n\nBased on the documentation, here are the key video generation models:\n\n## Primary Video Models\n\n**Gen-4.5**\n- Model ID: `gen4.5`\n- Inputs: Text or Image\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n- Features: \"true HDR renders — graded into BT.2020 with measured HDR10 metadata\"\n- Output formats: HDR10, HLG, ProRes, PNG sequences, 10-bit SDR\n\n**Seedance 2.5**\n- Model ID: `seedance2_5`\n- Inputs: Text, Image, or Video\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n\n**Aleph 2**\n- Model ID: `aleph2`\n- Inputs: Video + Text/Image\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/video_to_video`\n- Note: Does not deliver native HDR; use SDR to HDR conversion for HDR content\n\n**Gen-4 Turbo**\n- Model ID: `gen4_turbo`\n- Inputs: Image only\n- Endpoint: `POST /v1/image_to_video`\n\n## Additional Options\n\nOther available models include `wan3`, `hailuo3`, `veo3.1`, `h3_max`, and `happyhorse_1_0`. The documentation does not specify duration limits or aspect ratio options for individual models in the provided content.","durationMs":5089,"url":"https://docs.dev.runwayml.com/guides/models/"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c94a434c-2982-47a9-b605-982505f3efbf","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_cowork","cwd":"/home/claude","sessionId":"f6c49162-7b81-5373-a7c1-f58edfefee41","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"swirling-plotting-octopus"}
